body:
The `post-division-message` middleware was directly checking environment variables instead of using the centralized `isDev()` helper, inconsistent with other middleware files.

## Changes

- Import and use `isDev()` helper from config module
- Replace `process.env.ENVIRONMENT`/`process.env.NODE_ENV` checks with `isDev()`
- Replace `process.env.DEV_BYPASS_MIDDLEWARE` check with `CONFIG.DEV_BYPASS`

```typescript
// Before
const isDevEnv = process.env.ENVIRONMENT === "development" || process.env.NODE_ENV === "development";
const bypass = process.env.DEV_BYPASS_MIDDLEWARE === "true";
if (isDevEnv || bypass) return;

// After
if (isDev() || CONFIG.DEV_BYPASS) return;
```

Aligns with pattern used in `add-merit/+middleware.ts` and `development/+middleware.ts`.

